      "id": "claim_94fb1cba61a646009700e74a5ed4fc73",
      "statement": "The consents gate exists only as a server-side Guards rule: the client ships the acceptance overlay in every build, and when only ulabase.setup.ts has been applied no rule exists, no request is ever answered 451, and the acceptance dialog never opens. There is no app-side flag to switch the gate off — an unasked question is the absence of a rule on the server.",
