        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_db0e4884369f4cc59a6d8a219af08252",
      "statement": "appPointsAtService runs last on purpose so that a setup which stopped halfway leaves the 'connect your service' ConfigPage rather than a sign-up page that fails; its apply rewrites only the apiUrl line of src/environments/environment.ts and leaves comments and feature flags untouched. It is exported so a setup file that extends the base — such as ulabase.setup.consents.ts — can keep it in the final position after appending the gate's steps.",
